{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118608","id":3533973371,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7SpCd7","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118608","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118608.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118608.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118608","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118608/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118608/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118608/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8e30e2ee899d68b38c1f7f54e02d13487852e479","number":118608,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix BaseButton multitouch signals firing for only 1 button","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #118581.\r\n\r\nRegression from #110893.\r\n\r\nMultitouch `button_down` / `button_up` signals only fired for one button at a time. When a second\r\n`InputEventScreenTouch` press arrived on another button, `on_action_event()` rejected it because\r\n`status.hovering` is only set by mouse motion and the event was not treated as an accept event, so\r\n`status.press_attempt` never became true and no signal was emitted.\r\n\r\nAlso accept the press when the touch event targets a button whose `pressing_inside` is already true\r\n(i.e. the touch that started inside the button's rect), so each button processes its own touch stream\r\nindependently and multiple buttons can emit `button_down` / `button_up` simultaneously.\r\n\r\n- Verified on iOS Safari with a Web export of the MRP, pressing 4 buttons simultaneously with 4 fingers.\r\n    \r\n    https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8c20ce9f-247e-44f5-ab2d-0a34f2e75aa4\r\n\r\n- Verified on Android Chrome\r\n    \r\n    https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d4108a70-1778-4bc4-b972-c64be668745b\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","descripti